    {
      "id": "YlnXecmNWKbJ96WW8_vvK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 14288.218863668626,
      "y": 1079.3691332052992,
      "width": 1105.7791748046875,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2081717354,
      "version": 1542,
      "versionNonce": 378280106,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1752172915680,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solution for nearby driver\n\n-> Geohash maintain of driver.\n-> maintain the list of driver in one above geohash in sorted set redis.\n-> location update -> remove and add. \n\n\nFlows:\n- user tell about source and destination\n- rider service call the ETA service and it will tell the pricing and time for all vehicle type.\n- send to rider\n- rider select one -> request to backend server for ride creation. and it return rideId for polling.\n- also backend find the nearby driver with source location geohash with helop of location service.\n- it call notifcation service for sendign notifcation fo dricer\n- driver accept that ride.\n- backend server create the trip and update ride status. \n- driver get tripId in response and redirect to trip page. \n- one user get to know update about the ride. it fetch the trip for that ride.\n- and redirect to that page.\n- one both redirect to the trip management page, then will send websocket connection to trip managemtn service.\n- and both will share their location and that will be exchange by tripmangement service. to see on map. \n- after reach destination, finished call by driver.\n- and reditect to payment paze. \n \n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solution for nearby driver\n\n-> Geohash maintain of driver.\n-> maintain the list of driver in one above geohash in sorted set redis.\n-> location update -> remove and add. \n\n\nFlows:\n- user tell about source and destination\n- rider service call the ETA service and it will tell the pricing and time for all vehicle type.\n- send to rider\n- rider select one -> request to backend server for ride creation. and it return rideId for polling.\n- also backend find the nearby driver with source location geohash with helop of location service.\n- it call notifcation service for sendign notifcation fo dricer\n- driver accept that ride.\n- backend server create the trip and update ride status. \n- driver get tripId in response and redirect to trip page. \n- one user get to know update about the ride. it fetch the trip for that ride.\n- and redirect to that page.\n- one both redirect to the trip management page, then will send websocket connection to trip managemtn service.\n- and both will share their location and that will be exchange by tripmangement service. to see on map. \n- after reach destination, finished call by driver.\n- and reditect to payment paze. \n \n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
